Classroom desktop inspiration notice
------------------------------------

The "Escritorio docente" board template is inspired by the educational desktop
approach of the open source project `jjdeharo/escritorio`.

Upstream repository: https://github.com/jjdeharo/escritorio
Reviewed upstream commit: 9c939e8c6bb2105a4e54ad4a21ffeb4ebd189523
Repository author metadata: Juan Jose de Haro <jjdeharo@gmail.com>

The upstream README credits the original "Escritorio Interactivo para el Aula"
idea to Maria Teresa Gonzalez, and credits the React version/collaboration to
Maria Teresa Gonzalez and Juan Jose de Haro. The upstream README states the
project uses Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
